                                "sense_id": "a5955a03-c7f1-3bfa-8bc8-6969e160a84c",
                                "text": "[…] he has nary a Sword-and-Bucklerman in his Fair, nor a little Davy to take toll o' the Bawds there, as in my time, nor a Kindheart, if anybody's teeth should chance to ache in his Play."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "57488027-460b-4743-bdea-cfea96da112f",
                                "sense_id": "a5955a03-c7f1-3bfa-8bc8-6969e160a84c",
                                "text": "It could as likely be a killer as a kindheart, and he had no wish for the knife within him to be matched by a real knife of iron from without."
